6
00:00:09.566 --> 00:00:10.000
¿no?

7
00:00:13.266 --> 00:00:14.433
He querido decir esto.

8
00:00:15.133 --> 00:00:15.866
Esa carta de amor,

9
00:00:16.033 --> 00:00:16.766
Lo iba a quemar.

10
00:00:17.500 --> 00:00:17.833
el segundo

11
00:00:17.833 --> 00:00:18.533
Descubrí que eres

12
00:00:18.533 --> 00:00:19.233
mi hermanastro,

13
00:00:19.233 --> 00:00:20.133
